ded the ammunition with a pinpoint cross, allowing Ferran Torres to rise and power a header into the bottom right corner. The final stages were frantic, with Ludovic Blas nearly stealing a win for Rennes with a blocked header, while Mika Godts sent a late effort wide for the visitors. Ultimately, the points were shared after a breathless encounter that showcased the best of French football."
